cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "estkit: a header-only C++17 library and benchmark of state estimators and observers for battery-management systems in electric aircraft"
message: "If you use estkit, its benchmark or its report, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Anil"
    given-names: "Sreeram"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-19"
license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/anilram30/estkit"
url: "https://anilram30.github.io/estkit"
keywords:
  - state estimation
  - Kalman filter
  - observers
  - battery management system
  - state of charge
  - state of health
  - moving horizon estimation
  - particle filter
  - attitude estimation
  - embedded C++
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free, header-only C++17 library of 86 state estimators and observers
  (70 cell-level, 7 pack-level, 9 attitude) written against one model-agnostic
  interface, without dynamic memory or exceptions, in single or double precision,
  together with a reproducible benchmark on equivalent-circuit and electrochemical
  battery plants, a 12-cell pack, a 120-mission ageing study and an instrumented
  flight, cross-validated against FilterPy, PyBaMM and ahrs, and documented in a
  958-page report with one chapter per estimator.
